to manage all of your 3D, video, and audio content.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/e35f568d3ccd7529c6ed6dd1dfb76cb9.webp?t=1753982640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/2a3c570a7ddd1538c40a2f5bf9c76cac.poster.avif?t=1753982640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/2a3c570a7ddd1538c40a2f5bf9c76cac.webm?t=1753982640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/2a3c570a7ddd1538c40a2f5bf9c76cac.mp4?t=1753982640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let it rain, burn or smoke with Particles, add interactions, or co-create with AI using voice commands. StellarX lets you create experiences that enable more than just watching.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/ec36fb487addc4ac7ecec8935b29fe56.webp?t=1753982640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/3684ec855c631494ddfb228e64bfe87e.poster.avif?t=1753982640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/3684ec855c631494ddfb228e64bfe87e.webm?t=1753982640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/3684ec855c631494ddfb228e64bfe87e.mp4?t=1753982640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join collaborators in real-time inside your immersive world of choice. Meet, iterate, create, or simply experience a virtual world together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/0fed2056ea5ab86e32ef18df6073ede7.webp?t=1753982640\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/46a0c3fb97b429864d276ba76989f0e6.poster.avif?t=1753982640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/46a0c3fb97b429864d276ba76989f0e6.webm?t=1753982640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/46a0c3fb97b429864d276ba76989f0e6.mp4?t=1753982640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a step further into immersion with StellarX\u2019s Mixed Reality functionalities. Gain assistance on real life tasks, boost situational awareness, elevate sensory experiences, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/a70355eb2e0bbd0a72d97a49a3fde00d.webp?t=1753982640\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/863e3d402a974e6aaebea0873827d264.poster.avif?t=1753982640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/863e3d402a974e6aaebea0873827d264.webm?t=1753982640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214640/extras/863e3d402a974e6aaebea0873827d264.mp4?t=1753982640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conversational AI Agents make your experience fuller by answering questions, conversing with players to give more context, and by transferring knowledge specific to your use-case (Agents are in Beta Testing). NPCs are customizable avatars that deliver pre-scripted dialogue and movements, bringing your vision to life. Available on paid plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive technologies are transforming entire industries as we speak, empowering individuals to better themselves and to create without bounds. From safety training to healthcare treatment, virtual classrooms, predictive maintenance, and more\u2014anything is possible with StellarX!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">StellarX has a few subscription plans based on your needs. You can get started on our Free plan or explore our website for other plans that come with more features and personalized support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powered by OVA, StellarX was put forward with help from the Canada Media Fund (CMF)</p>",
